# The stock cppia host, cpp.cppia.Host, with Nekomata compiled in: libhxcpp's loader
#  hands it .n modules through nekomata.CppiaFormat, so it runs them as it runs .cppia
#  scripts: bin/cppia/Cppia [-jit] <file.n | file.cppia> [args...]
# The flags are those of libhxcpp's project/compile-cppia.hxml, and what Nekomata's
#  runtime needs
-cp src
--main cpp.cppia.Host
nekomata.CppiaFormat
# The runtime is only named by generated scripts, so nothing else pulls it in
--macro include("nekomata.rt")
-D scriptable
-D dll_export=
--dce no
-D HXCPP_CATCH_SEGV
-D hxcpp_smart_strings
# Neko reports where an uncaught exception came from, and $callstack and $excstack
#  read the stack, so script frames keep their file and line
-D HXCPP_STACK_TRACE
-D HXCPP_STACK_LINE
-D HAXE_OUTPUT_FILE=Cppia
--cpp bin/cppia
